   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Until I Am Whole**: back after 31 archived shows (1167 days) [3]\n- **Sept 19 Triple X Love! Love!**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Maize Stalk Drinking Blood**: back after 189 archived shows (5985 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Going to Kansas**: back after 75 archived shows (2528 days); rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **White Cedar**: back after 23 archived shows (946 days) [3]\n- **Liza Forever Minnelli**: back after 51 archived shows (1719 days) [3]\n- **The Dinosauri**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Going to Bogota**: back after 183 archived shows (5105 days) [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: We Do It Different on the West Coast [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2016-02-27.SBD.AUD.Matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 84 min [1]\n- **tmg2016-02-27.sah**: audience recording; 18 songs; 83 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2016-02-27.SBD.AUD.Matrix**: taped by blg; transferred by blg; source: 2 Source Mix: [SBD > M10] + [Schoeps CCM4’s > Tinybox > M10] => FLAC [1]. Also: Mastering used Adobe Audition, iZotope Ozone 5, WavePad, and xACT to create FLAC [1]\n- **tmg2016-02-27.sah**: taped by The Annotated Mountain Goats; source: Audience recording [2]",
